                    <hi rendition="#italic">Infra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d764-f2" n="2" xml:id="d764-f2-content">
                <p>Marginal notation by Mr. Lovett: “Phoned Key West 5:20 Nov 16th.”</p>
            </note>
